      <title>MapQuest拒改安大略湖为美国湖后登顶加拿大App Store</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/MapQuest%E6%8B%92%E6%94%B9%E5%AE%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%95%A5%E6%B9%96%E4%B8%BA%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%B9%96%E5%90%8E%E7%99%BB%E9%A1%B6%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%BF%E5%A4%A7App-Store/</link>
